WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:03.100
<v Host>So what changed when you stopped posting every day?

00:03.600 --> 00:05.600
<v Guest>Honestly? I started finishing things.

00:06.300 --> 00:09.600
<v Guest>A finished video beats a rushed one, every single time.

00:10.200 --> 00:11.900
<v Host>Even if the views drop at first?

00:12.500 --> 00:16.400
<v Guest>They did drop. Then the people who stayed actually watched.

00:17.000 --> 00:18.600
<v Host>That is the clip, right there.
